      "post_subject": "IPA Question",
      "content_md": "I've collected a fair amount of IPA over the years and not sure what to do with it.\n\nIf I measure the SP of IPA to water and it looks clean (ran through filters) is there any reason that it is not good? Are there other contaminates or some kind of chemical break down that renders it unuseable?\n\nThanks.\n\nTony",
