      "post_subject": "IPA Question",
      "content_md": "No, I used my 99 for 90 then down to 70, 50 30. I have never had issues. Just make sure its clean like you stated. If it starts to look real yellowish or bluish, you may need to watch it, but it should not be turning yellow or blue or you are not rinsing enough after the fixing.",
